{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"nl -ba pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_plan.go | sed -n '65,95p' && rg -n 'tool.*component|Components.*Tools|planned tool|plan.Tools' pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_rounds.go pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_draft_check.go\"","aggregated_output":"    65\t// about which criteria a reviewer still owes an answer for.\n    66\tfunc ReviewCriterionKind(criterion ReviewPlanCriterion) string {\n    67\t\tif criterion.Kind == ReviewCriterionKindMechanical || criterion.Kind == ReviewCriterionKindJudgment {\n    68\t\t\treturn criterion.Kind\n    69\t\t}\n    70\t\treturn DeriveReviewCriterionKind(criterion.EvidenceClasses)\n    71\t}\n    72\t\n    73\ttype ReviewPlanTool struct {\n    74\t\tID           string `json:\"id\"`\n    75\t\tRequiredness string `json:\"requiredness\"`\n    76\t\t// ProducerCoverage is `none` when the component this tool is scoped to\n    77\t\t// declares, in the validation matrix, that it runs no check at all. The\n    78\t\t// plan then asks for evidence nothing in the repository can emit, and a\n    79\t\t// required tool may only be disposed `passed` or `failed` citing a result\n    80\t\t// of a class it accepts — so the reviewer's options are to cite another\n    81\t\t// component's result, which is false, or to stay blocked forever.\n    82\t\t//\n    83\t\t// This is the same failure the profile loader already refuses one level up:\n    84\t\t// a profile demanding a class no registered check may emit plans a gate\n    85\t\t// only a fabricated disposition can pass. Per component, the matrix is what\n    86\t\t// says so, and the plan had not been reading it.\n    87\t\t//\n    88\t\t// Empty means the ordinary case: producers exist, or the matrix does not\n    89\t\t// say otherwise and the tool stays required. The engine claims the gap only\n    90\t\t// where the repository declared it.\n    91\t\tProducerCoverage string   `json:\"producer_coverage,omitempty\"`\n    92\t\tArgs             []string `json:\"args\"`\n    93\t\tRationale        string   `json:\"rationale\"`\n    94\t\tEvidenceClasses  []string `json:\"evidence_classes,omitempty\"`\n    95\t\tCriteria         []string `json:\"criteria,omitempty\"`\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
